@startuml
title CTI E2 - componentes de producao
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
component "app/app.py" as App
component "dados / recortes" as Dados
component "indicadores /\nsensibilidade" as KPI
component "distribuicao /\nformatacao" as Dist
component agregados as Ag
component regressao as Reg
component executar_e2 as Exec
component versao as Versao
component "leitura gerencial" as Leitura
component "relatorio PDF" as Relatorio
artifact agregados_cti.json as Json
artifact evidencias_e2.json as Ev
artifact "Parquet / prepara E1" as Local
artifact "Git HEAD local" as Git
App ..> Dados
App ..> KPI
App ..> Dist
App ..> Ag
App ..> Reg
App ..> Versao
App ..> Leitura
App ..> Relatorio : sob demanda
Relatorio ..> KPI
Relatorio ..> Leitura
Relatorio ..> Dist : formatacao
Versao ..> Git : identifica checkout
Dados ..> Local
Ag ..> Json : medias / percentis
Ag ..> Ev : regressao publicada
Exec ..> Local : preparacao
Exec ..> Reg : avaliacao
note bottom of App
Producao: CTI agregada.
Demo: CTI_DEMO=1.
Local: CTI_BASE_LOCAL.
Fonte invalida: bloqueio.
end note
@enduml
